# Dynamic map replacement performance

Measures repeated replacement of one existing key while two untouched entries
keep the map shape stable. The final value is printed after the timed loop.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let values = {
    "first": 0,
    "second": 1,
    "third": 2
}

for (iteration in 0..100000) {
    values["second"] = iteration
}

print(values["second"])
